    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d529-a4">

                <pb facs="0730" n="636" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg636"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure 3 to inclosure 1 in No.
                    517.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hyatt to the
                            Governor of Santiago de Cuba.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Santiago
                                de Cuba</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-04-10"><hi rendition="#italic">April 10,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carlos
                        Dennis</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Governor of the Oriental Region and
                        of the Province of Santiago de Cuba</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith for
                    your excellency’s information a manifold copy of a letter to-day sent by me to
                    the honorable commandante de marine in regard to the arrest and trial
                    jurisdiction of Bert S. Skiller, confined in the carcel of this city.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pulaski F. Hyatt</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">United States Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
